# The scenario editor's keys and clicks on the map of the first GDI mission.
# Waypoints: a click picks a cell, Alt with a letter labels it, Shift-R makes
# it the reinforcement cell and Alt-Space takes its letter away. Objects:
# Insert starts placing, Right and Page Down go through the objects and their
# kinds, a click puts one down and Esc stops. The controls that pop up for a
# selected object: the strength gauge dragged, the facing dial, the mission
# list scrolled by its arrow, the house buttons; Tab for the next object and
# Delete. F6 shows where units can go.
# args: -EDITOR
# The map scrolls for as long as the pointer rests in the screen's corner.
at 201 move 300 100
# A click on the map has to last: the editor asks whether the button is still
# down when it gets to the click.
at 211 press 460 300
at 215 release 460 300
at 230 shot cell_picked
at 231 keydown ALT
at 232 key A
at 235 keyup ALT
at 250 shot waypoint_a
at 251 press 430 270
at 255 release 430 270
at 261 keydown SHIFT
at 262 key R
at 265 keyup SHIFT
at 280 shot reinforcement_cell
at 281 press 460 300
at 285 release 460 300
at 291 keydown ALT
at 292 key SPACE
at 295 keyup ALT
at 310 shot waypoint_a_removed
at 331 key INSERT
at 341 key RIGHT
at 360 shot placing_first_kind
at 361 key PGDN
at 380 shot placing_next_kind
at 381 press 480 250
at 385 release 480 250
at 391 move 400 150
at 410 shot object_placed
at 411 key ESC
at 430 shot placing_stopped
at 431 press 508 322
at 435 release 508 322
at 450 shot soldier_selected
at 451 press 480 350
at 455 move 450 350
at 460 move 430 362
at 465 shot strength_dragging
at 466 release 430 362
at 480 shot strength_dragged
at 481 click 372 350
at 500 shot facing_east
at 501 click 292 372
at 505 click 292 372
at 520 shot missions_scrolled
at 521 click 200 345
at 540 shot mission_chosen
at 541 click 70 347
at 560 shot house_nod
at 561 key TAB
at 580 shot next_object
at 581 key DELETE
at 600 shot object_deleted
at 601 key F6
at 620 shot passable_cells
at 621 quit
